<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>My IT Student Portfolio</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f1f5f9;
  color: #1e293b;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
header {
  background: #0f172a;
  color: white;
  padding: 20px 8%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}
header h2 { color: #38bdf8; }
nav a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin: 0 8px;
}
nav a:hover { color: #38bdf8; }
.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1d4ed8);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 85px 20px;
}
.hero h1 { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.hero p { margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 18px; }
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #38bdf8;
  color: #0f172a;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
}
section { padding: 50px 8%; }
section h2 {
  text-align: center;
  color: #1d4ed8;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}
.card-container {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 20px;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #00000012;
  flex: 1 1 220px;
  max-width: 350px;
}
.card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; color: #0f172a; }
#contact { text-align: center; background: #e2e8f0; }
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
  background: #0f172a;
  color: white;
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  header { justify-content: center; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 30px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h2>My Portfolio</h2>
  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
    <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Hello, I'm an IT Student</h1>
  <p>Learning programming, networking and web development.</p>
  <a href="#projects" class="btn">View My Projects</a>
</div>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About Me</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p>I am an Information Technology student passionate about computers,
    programming, networking and creating websites. I am developing my
    skills through practical projects and continuous learning.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="skills">
  <h2>My IT Skills</h2>
  <div class="card-container">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>HTML &amp; CSS</h3>
      <p>Building and styling web pages.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Programming</h3>
      <p>Learning Java and C programming.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Networking</h3>
      <p>Studying computer networks and communication.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="projects">
  <h2>My Projects</h2>
  <div class="card-container">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>My First Website</h3>
      <p>A personal portfolio built with HTML and CSS.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Programming Practice</h3>
      <p>Small programs created while learning programming.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Networking Studies</h3>
      <p>Practical exercises in computer networking.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>Contact Me</h2>
  <p>You can contact me about IT projects and learning opportunities.</p>
  <p>Add your email address here when you are ready.</p>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>&copy; 2026 My IT Student Portfolio. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
